0012:   segments_for_crossing:
0013:     red: horizontal span cols [c-4 .. c] at row r
0014:     green: vertical span rows [r .. r+3] at col c
0015:     pink: vertical span rows [r-6 .. r] at col c
0016:   crossings: where red horizontal intersects a green/pink vertical (cell must be bg in input)
0017:   yellow_diagonal: from each crossing (r,c), paint yellow going (r+1,c-1), (r+1,c-1)... to grid edge
0018:   non_overlap: all trail cells, endpoints, and yellow diagonal cells must be bg(0) in input; no endpoint overlaps another endpoint or trail (crossing grey cells may overlap between red and vertical trail)
