0030:     5. Verify exterior destination cells (r0-1,c0-1), (r0-1,c1+1), (r1+1,c0-1), (r1+1,c1+1) are within grid and bg.
0031:     6. This directly produces a valid input; output is derived by moving markers to opposite exterior corners.

